   "line": 1,
   "text": "Your keypad detector runs live: every block of two hundred fifty-six samples, it matches eight test wheels, its bins, one per keypad tone, against a twelve percent bar. Then two complaints arrive. Loud presses of four get thrown out, since the seven's row clears the bar too. And faint rural keys are never heard.",
