   "line": 3,
   "text": "Shrink it to a napkin: eight samples, bins a thousand hertz apart. A thousand hertz tone sits on its bin: one hundred percent, and zero everywhere else. Move it halfway, to fifteen hundred: sixty and seventy in the nearest bins, and the tone spreads past them into all the others. That's leakage.",
