   "text": "On the keypad, the seven's bin sits on a side lobe of seven seventy. Depending on where each tone starts in the block, a loud four leaks about nine to fifteen percent there, and a faint key can score under eight. A faint key's real tone is weaker than a loud key's leak. No bar fits.",
